d this turn without paying their mana costs.", 'Flying\nWhenever another creature you control dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Guardian Kirin.', 'Flying\n{2}{U}: Another target creature gains flying until end of turn.\nChannel — {X}{U}, Discard Ghost-Lit Drifter: X target creatures gain flying until end of turn.', 'Flying\n{R}: Arcbound Whelp gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\nModular 2 (This creature enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it. When it dies, you may put its +1/+1 counters on target artifact creature.)', 'Flying\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Flying\n{W}: Marble Gargoyle gets +0/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying, haste\nMadness {B} (If you discard this card, discard it into exile. When you do, cast it for its madness cost or put it into your graveyard.)', 'Flying, lifelink', 'Flying, lifelink\nAt the beginning of each combat, if you have more life than an opponent, Glorious Enforcer gains double strike until end of turn.', 'Flying, lifelink\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Piru, the Volatile unless you pay {R}{W}{B}.\nWhen Piru dies, it deals 7 damage to each nonlegendary creature.', 'Flying, lifelink\nWhenever Breathless Knight or another creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature entered from a graveyard or you cast it from a graveyard, put a +1/+1 counter on Breathless Knight.', 'Flying, protection from artifacts', 'Flying, protection from black\nEcho {3}{W}{W} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\nWhen Karmic Guide enters the battlefield, return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Flying, vigilance\nOther nontoken creatures you control get +1/+1 and have vigilance.', "Forestwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)\nIf one or more tokens would be created under your control, those tokens plus that many 1/1 green Squirrel cre